      "writtenOn": "2023-01-26T03:30:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: Does `stdLib` come from Python terminology?\n\nAt first, I confused it with C stdlib (libc, ...). WDYT about using a different name?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 572,
        "startChar": 5,
