      "writtenOn": "2023-01-26T03:30:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "WDYT about removing `delete\u003dFalse` and rewriting it as\n```\nwith NamedTemporaryFile(prefix\u003d\"...\") as tmp_in, NamedTemporaryFile(prefix\u003d\"...\") as tmp_out:\n```\nThat way, you dont need the explicit `remove` in the finally block\n\nI would even drop the prefix. It makes the code more concise, and it is a temporary file anyways.",
